// Extension control in the editor (§9.1): writing syntax outside the module for entity with
// [[extension(own_only)]] (recording twice the module geo.shapes) - check error mark on the
// extension announcement; renaming in your word - new entity program, not extension: no tag.
//
// program: editor_extension.tz
open_view module
// expect: kind="error" text="twice: расширять сущности модуля geo.shapes можно только в нём (own_only)
// expect: kind="n_fn" pieces=["syntax twice {body} again => "
pointer 1 @syntax 0 12
key 1 Backspace
key 1 y
// expect: kind="n_fn" pieces=["syntax twicy " #
// expect: syntax twicy {body} again => {
idle
// expect-not: kind="error"
